While you were away, the Rakoo, Guardians of the Tree of Life, affected by the Fire Soul, nearly destroyed it. The Igolanos summoned horrible creatures using the Blood Moon.
Those were critical moments, but we got through them.
Arteres told me you also went through trouble.
Are you all right? I am very grateful for your effort.

I can feel the Crios's insanity in these blades. It is a terrible power. I must purify them so they can be used to create the Magic Censer.
With the teachings of the Mystic Avas, Salon will be able to create the Magic Censer with this metal.
I will begin purifying the blades.

Please, come back later.
